            step('S = 2 d, \\quad A = 0.22\\, e^{-(d/w)^2}, \\quad \\text{coverage} = e^{-(d/w)^2}', 'The same three outputs as the pinched shells, so it can replace them: S follows the ring, A glows on it with width w.')
